  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Choose-Your-Own Outcome\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nPlan a short story where the user’s **two choices** lead to **four possible endings**. Use your chosen scenario to plan the app’s logic:\r\n\r\n1. Define the **inputs** (states or controls) that drive each decision (diamond).\r\n   \r\n2. Draw **two diamonds** and **at least three leaves**, labeling each leaf with the **exact UI outcome**.\r\n\r\n3. Draft a **Test Cases table** with one row for each leaf, showing how the inputs lead to each outcome.\r\n\r\n4. **Export** your flowchart as a PNG and add it to your project folder in the next level.\r\n",
    "display_name": "Choose-Your-Own Outcome",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Build a branching story with two choices and four endings.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/ae61129f18571ffcac5a1921ec5e826f-trail.png",
